## Acceptance criteria

- [x] Pinching switches between fixed Overview and Detail levels.
- [x] The zoom control is removed.
- [x] Zoom works in view and edit modes.
- [x] Detail mode supports bounded single-finger panning.
- [x] Tapping a hex in Detail mode centres it.
